<title>UK: Bradford wool market edges higher with Australia.</title>
<headline>Bradford wool market edges higher with Australia.</headline>
<dateline>BRADFORD 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Topmakers quotations edged as much as three pence per kilo higher influenced by similar moves in Australia, brokers said.</p>
<p>However, currency factors are still the main factor behind an uncertain market resulting in a cautious approach to fresh buying, they added.</p>
<p>Deliveries are going out well but throughout the market there was talk of highly competitive pricing.</p>
<p>Christams influences are meanwhile said to be on the increase.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
</text>
